  "description": "Convenience meta-package that pulls in every NetPdf language pack — European, CJK, Arabic, and Indic — and registers them all with NetPdf's HyphenationRegistry in one call. Installing NetPdf.Languages.All is equivalent to installing NetPdf.Languages.European + .Cjk + .Arabic + .Indic. Call AllLanguages.Register at startup; a module initializer also drives it on assembly load.",
